   "lines": [
    "I like very much the",
    "text over the door",
    "of our Church:- \"Be",
    "ye doers of the word",
    "and not hearers",
    "only\". I am no",
    "believer in faith",
    "without works.",
    "Have been reading",
    "the beautiful \"Memorial",
    "of Theodore Roosevelt\".",
    "With God's help I",
    "shall try to lead",
    "such a life as",
    "Father would have",
    "wished me to."
   ],
